，亦因謂甲：「即事成，幸言偃女願得充王後宮。」甲既至齊，風以此事。紀太后大怒，曰：「王有后，後宮具備。且甲，齊貧人，急乃為宦者，入事漢，無補益，乃欲亂吾王家！且主父偃何為者？乃欲以女充後宮！」徐甲大窮，還報皇太后曰：「王已願尚娥，然有一害，恐如燕王。」燕王者，與其子昆弟姦，新坐以死，亡國，故以燕感太后。太后曰：「無復言嫁女齊事。」事浸潯［不得］聞於天子。主父偃由此亦與齊有卻。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"徐甲","kind":"person","person_id":"y9m_l4i_das","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0009","start":9,"end":13,"surface":"漢皇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"mjn_ohc_9ca","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0014","start":14,"end":17,"surface":"皇太后","kind":"person","person_id":"mjn_ohc_9ca","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0021","start":21,"end":24,"surface":"修成君","kind":"person","person_id":"9px_mn4_w7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"修成君","kind":"person","person_id":"9px_mn4_w7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"mjn_ohc_9ca","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"修成君","kind":"person","person_id":"9px_mn4_w7x","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0043","start":43,"end":44,"surface":"娥","kind":"person","person_id":"vur_b8c_5er","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"太后","kind":"person","person_id":"mjn_ohc_9ca","status":"contextual_provisional","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"甲","kind":"person","person_id":"y9m_l4i_das","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m028-0068","start":68,"end":69,"surface":"娥","kind":"person","person_id":"vur_b8c_5er","status":"con